Hi<%= " #{@invitation.person.first_name}" if @invitation.person %>,

<%= @sender || "An organizer" %> invited you to <%= @family.name %>, <%= @family.terms.intro %>.
<% if @organizers.any? %>
Organized by: <%= @organizers.to_sentence %>.
<% end %><% if @reunion %>
What is planned: <%= @reunion.title %><%= ", #{@reunion.starts_on.strftime('%B %-d, %Y')}" if @reunion.dated? %><%= ", #{@reunion.location_name}" if @reunion.location_name.present? %>.
<% end %>
You are being invited as <%= @role == "organizer" ? "an organizer, which means you can help plan, invite people and send reminders" : "a member" %>.

Use this one-time link to choose your name and password:

<%= @url %>

The link works once and expires in 7 days. If it stops working, ask <%= @sender || "an organizer" %> for a new one.

The site is invite-only and hidden from search engines. Other members see only the display name you choose; your email is shown only to the organizers.
<% if @inviter&.email.present? %>
Reply to this email to reach <%= @sender || "the person who invited you" %>.
<% end %>
If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this message and nothing will happen.
